{"results":[{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_triveni-kaveri-borivali-west_3090.html","title":"Triveni Kaveri Borivali West Mumbai - PropertyCrow.com","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Borivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-borivali-west_1_1_0_0_26.html)\n›4. [Triveni Kaveri](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_triveni-kaveri-borivali-west_3090.html)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22739.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22739.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - 3bhk flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22740.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - 3D  flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22741.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - Layout Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22742.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - Master Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22743.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - 3bhk flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22740.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - 3D  flr plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22741.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - Layout Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22742.jpeg)\n\n![Triveni Kaveri - Master Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/photo-22743.jpeg)\n\nby Triveni Developers\n\n# Triveni Kaveri\n\nI C Colony, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3 BHK\n\nSize 524 Sq.ft To 909 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹1.36 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919820575619\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow3090\n\nPossession Status Ready to Move in Since December 2017\n\nRERA P51800007976  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## TRIVENI KAVERI\n\n**Triveni Kaveri** CHS is a housing project designed by Triveni Developers. The project provides well developed 2 BHK & 3 BHK flats 524 Sq.ft To 909 Sq.ft Carpet Area at very inexpensive costs. The project is well linked by many modes of transport. The site is in close distance to several civic resou\n\nrces.\n\n**Advantage of Location:**\n\nBorivali is one of Mumbai most well-known suburban areas and is separated into East and West via the railway line operating through the area. The people of the area has surpassed the 1 million mark in recent times. This suburban area is popular with home buyers on profile of outstanding connections to all major locations in Mumbai. The SV Road and the western suburban railway system also link it to many locations in the city with ease. Borivali West is known for its attractive gardens and is one of the most well managed suburban areas in Mumbai. The mangrove jungles in Gorai are simply offered from this area along with the Sanjay Gandhi Park and Kanheri Caves. Borivali West provides efficient transport community via auto rickshaws, BEST buses and taxis, which link it to nearly all major parts of Mumbai with elan.\n\nTriveni Developers are leaders in building homes that are work of art. The styles are classy and modern in nature and we are proud of our exclusive improvements. Triveni Developers journey started by developing higher homes has given us an top hand and we have become the management in the aggressive market by our strength. We have designed homes that are niche. Our perspective is to develop homes that are much better, saves humanity and dynamics by its balanced and eco-friendly designs. The core value of turning dreams homes into reality became the objective of Triveni Developers.\n\n**For more details you may please contact us.**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 524 | 1.36 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 602 | 1.56 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 637 | 1.65 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 668 | 1.73 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 816 | 2.12 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 909 | 2.37 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Children Play area  \n\\* Power Back Up  \n\\* Security  \n\\* Rain Water Harvesting  \n\\* Landscaped Garden  \n\\* Lift  \n\\* Water line connections  \n\\* Covered Car Parking\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**FLOORING:**  \n\\* 2X2 vitrified flooring in all rooms  \n\\* 1X1 anti-Skid tiles in bathrooms    \n  \n**KITCHEN:**  \n\\* Granite kitchen platform with S.S. sink  \n  \n**BATH:**  \n\\* Designer color ceramics tiles in bathroom  \n\\* Concealed plumbing with good quality CP brass fittings  \n\\* Good quality geyser and exhaust fan in all bathrooms   \n  \n**DOORS AND WINDOWS:**  \n\\* Color anodized aluminum sliding windows  \n\\* Flush doors in bath rooms  \n\\* Paneled doors in every room with elegant handles and locks  \n\\* Granite window sill with half round molding   \n  \n**WALLS AND PAINTS:**  \n\\* Good quality paint in all rooms  \n  \n**ELECTRIFICATION:**  \n\\* Concealed copper wiring and top quality electric fittings of leading brand in all rooms  \n\\* Independent distribution boxes  \n\\* Telephone, TV and internal points in living and bedrooms\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3090/qra_1959.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800007976\n\n**Developer:** Triveni Developers\n\n**Project:** Triveni Kaveri\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - I C Colony, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** I C Colony, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** IC Colony Croos Raod &Devki Nagar\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about TRIVENI KAVERI\n\nWhere is Triveni Kaveri Exactly located?\n\nT