BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Kaveri Gold developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kaveri-gold-13649.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Kaveri Heights Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Kaveri Heights Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kaveri-heights-project-project-large-image1-6615.jpg?aio=w-1140;h-350;crop;)\n\n**₹1.39 Cr - 1.60 Cr**\n\n₹25,450 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Kaveri Heights, Borivali West by Kaveri Gold\n\n## Kaveri Heights Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Kaveri Heights.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  892 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.39 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  977 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.52 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1031 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.60 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nKaveri Heights's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Kaveri Heights | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 25450 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 25250 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 25200 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 23550 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nKaveri Heights avg. price is ₹ 25.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Ajmera Yogi Nagar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-yogi-nagar/27019/project \"Ajmera Yogi Nagar\") | ₹ 38,250 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Bhoomi Legend](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/bhoomi-legend/3279/project \"Bhoomi Legend\") | ₹ 29,900 |\n| Current Project **Kaveri Heights** | ₹ 25,450 |\n| [Chandak Sparkling Wings](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-sparkling-wings/5946/project \"Chandak Sparkling Wings\") | ₹ 24,800 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Kaveri Heights | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Kaveri Heights.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Kaveri Heights, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Kaveri Heights ranges from ₹ 59 K to ₹ 72 K with options available for 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Kaveri Heights moved from ₹ 25,250/sqft to ₹ 25,450/sqft, reflecting a 0.79% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nKAVERI HEIGHTS Achieves 100% Construction Completion, Ready for Possession.\n\nA total of 14 out of 16 launched units have been booked as of April 2026, including, 100% of GR.FLOORCOMMERCIAL (1 units), 2 BHK (13 units).\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Kaveri Heights moved from ₹ 25,200/sqft to ₹ 25,250/sqft, reflecting a 0.20% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Kaveri Heights From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 22.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 2 Cr | ₹ 22,050 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Kaveri Heights Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 892 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kaveri Heights, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.39 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 977 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kaveri Heights, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.52 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1031 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kaveri Heights, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.60 Cr\n\n#