;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gokhale Education Society\n\n#### Pandya Hospital\n\n#### Netrajyoti Eye Care Centre\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Kaveri Heights\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Kaveri Heights From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 22.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2025-12-18 | Floor 10, Unit 1002 | B | 773 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Kaveri Heights compare with similar projects?\n\n![Kaveri Heights project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kaveri-heights-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kaveri Heights](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kaveri-heights/120545/project \"Kaveri Heights\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Bhoomi Legend project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-bhoomi-legend-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Bhoomi Legend](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/bhoomi-legend/3279/project \"Bhoomi Legend\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Kabra Nalanda project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareya